OL,3,APoundland's future hangs in the balance
OL,4,Aas chain edges towards collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland's bosses have filed a notice
OL,7,Fof intention to appoint administrators
OL,8,Fto the business, the BBC understands,
OL,9,Fraising fears about its collapse.
OL,11,FThe legal move, which has yet to be
OL,12,Fapproved by the High Court, gives the
OL,13,Fbusiness 10 days breathing space to
OL,14,Ffind a rescue deal.
OL,16,FPoundland's managing director Barry
OL,17,FWilliams wrote a memo to his 12,000
OL,18,Fstaff on Tuesday saying the American
OL,19,Fowner of the chain had limited the
OL,20,Fchain's access to funding.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
