OL,3,APoundland's future hangs in the balance
OL,4,Aas chain edges towards collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FGordon Brothers bought Poundland, which
OL,7,Fhad been struggling, from the Polish
OL,8,Fretail group Pepco last year for a
OL,9,Fnominal #1.
